# The four stills of the viewer's chrome, in one run.
#
# Coordinates are window pixels at 1360x860: the toolbar is a column of
# buttons centred on x=84, the canvas spans (186,44)..(757,615), and the
# inspector's rows run down the panel at x=1088.

wait 5000                   # let the progressive render settle

# --- docs/viewer.png -------------------------------------------------------
# Click to select; the gizmo and the inspector come with the selection.
drag 470 320 470 342 500    # a little orbit, to stand the floor in the frame
wait 2500
click 530 320               # the sphere
wait 3000
shot viewer

# --- docs/viewer-help.png --------------------------------------------------
# Every command in one place, the toolbar half of it generated from the
# buttons themselves.
key H
wait 1200
shot help
key Escape                  # close the help, leaving the sphere selected
wait 400

# --- docs/viewer-illuminance.png -------------------------------------------
# Every surface shaded by the illuminance arriving at it, read under the cursor.
key 3
wait 9000
move 400 500                # a point on the work surface
wait 800
shot illuminance

# --- docs/viewer-buttons.png -----------------------------------------------
# A refused button says why, in the same words its tooltip uses.
key Escape                  # deselect, so DUPLICATE and DELETE have nothing
wait 500
click 84 387                # DUPLICATE
wait 800
shot buttons
